---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/")
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL
  : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Awakening Dignity Practice Group"
  description="A free weekly Aylsham and online practice group exploring dignity, compassion, meditation, and meaningful connection. New members welcome until January."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Free Monday practice group</p>
      <h1>Awakening Dignity Across the Globe</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A six-month journey into inner dignity, compassion, and meaningful
        connection, meeting weekly in Aylsham and online. The current local
        group began on Monday 19 October 2026, and new participants are warmly
        welcome to join up to month 3 (until mid-January 2027).
      </p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@stillground.co.uk">Ask Jane about joining</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="https://www.samyeinstitute.org/awakening-dignity-across-the-globe/">
          Samye Institute information
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-media">
      <img
        src={`${base}assets/practice-group/awakening-dignity-across-the-globe.webp`}
        alt="Awakening Dignity Across the Globe programme image from Samye Institute"
        width="900"
        height="900"
        decoding="async"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <figcaption>Awakening Dignity Across the Globe</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="statement">
    <p>
      Rooted in ancient Buddhist wisdom yet fully accessible to all, this is not
      a religious programme. The book and online course are helpful resources,
      but they are not required to take part in the local practice group.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Now running</p>
      <h2>Started 19 October 2026: you&rsquo;re welcome to join</h2>
      <p>
        Jane facilitates a local practice group for the Awakening Dignity
        programme from the Samye Institute. The group is exploring the programme
        for a second time, having begun on Monday 19 October 2026.
      </p>
      <p>
        It&rsquo;s not too late to join. New participants are welcome up to month 3
        of the programme (until mid-January 2027), and Jane will help you catch
        up with anything you&rsquo;ve missed.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you&rsquo;re interested, get in touch and Jane can explain how the group
        works and whether the course is right for you.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="note-panel">
      <p class="small-label">Register interest</p>
      <p>
        Email Jane if you would like to join the group, or to ask whether the
        course is right for you.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@stillground.co.uk">Email Jane</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-grid" aria-label="What participants explore">
    <article>
      <h3>Basic goodness</h3>
      <p>Ground your life in the dignity and basic goodness already present.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Difficult emotions</h3>
      <p>Work with habitual patterns and emotional difficulty with more kindness.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Daily stability</h3>
      <p>Meet life's challenges with stability, clarity, compassion, and ease.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Weekly format</p>
      <h2>Read, meditate, contemplate, integrate</h2>
      <p>
        Each weekly session includes readings and videos to deepen understanding,
        meditation exercises to enhance experience, and contemplation to help
        integrate learning into daily life.
      </p>
      <p>
        Participants receive home practice resources each week to help build a
        steady, meaningful routine between sessions.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="note-panel">
      <p class="small-label">Meeting details</p>
      <ul class="list-clean">
        <li>Mondays, 9:30-11:00am GMT.</li>
        <li>No group on Monday 16 November.</li>
        <li>Please arrive by 9:15am for a prompt start.</li>
        <li>Course began Monday 19 October 2026. New members welcome until mid-January 2027.</li>
        <li>Aylsham, Norfolk, also available online.</li>
        <li>Bring a notebook and pen.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-narrow testimonial-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Kind words</p>
    <blockquote>
      <p>
        The course has enabled me to develop and deepen my meditation practice
        in a well structured and steadily progressive way. Jane has been a
        brilliant facilitator in helping us navigate the course material and
        in guiding us skillfully through the rich variety of practices and
        teachings.
      </p>
      <p>
        I would really recommend this course as a unique and precious opportunity
        to share these priceless teachings from a trusted lineage of meditation
        masters. It will undoubtedly bring benefit to your life and the lives of
        those around you.
      </p>
      <p>
        I have particularly enjoyed the great balance of teachings, study,
        discussion and reflection. I have really appreciated the chance to
        practice with such a friendly and supportive group.
      </p>
      <cite>Jill</cite>
    </blockquote>
    <blockquote>
      <p>
        I really wonder how different things would have been had I discovered
        these teachings sooner in my life. In my opinion this wonderful (and
        FREE!) course should be taught to everyone from an early age. It will
        help you to see things as they are and not how you have been conditioned
        to see them.
      </p>
      <p>
        It has been fascinating getting to know myself and learning to be quietly
        at one with myself &mdash; starting with five minutes of meditation and
        increasing to thirty minutes &mdash; and I am amazed at the many different
        techniques that we have learned.
      </p>
      <p>
        At the outset I had no experience of meditating but I need not have
        worried &mdash; Jane has been an amazing facilitator and has guided the
        group with kindness and insight from start to finish, and because of it
        the group atmosphere has been very much one of togetherness, benefitting
        us all.
      </p>
      <cite>Paula - Awakening Dignity Participant, March-October 2026</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-band">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Questions welcome</p>
      <h2>Contact Jane to join the group</h2>
      <p>Jane can explain the local group, online access, and the optional resources.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@stillground.co.uk">Email Jane</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
